00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:55,880
a program called a linker, which merges together all the different files for both your

262
00:25:55,880 --> 00:26:03,700
individual file, their compiled versions, and for the library code. And then finally, there's

263
00:26:03,700 --> 00:26:11,140
a, even once you run a program, there's actually some libraries that get imported dynamically when

